<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mth, 3-mth BUBOR rates drop, 6-mth flat.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mth, 3-mth BUBOR rates drop, 6-mth flat.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) dropped for the one- and three-month maturities and remained unchanged for six months, the National Bank of Hungary said on Monday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 20.80 percent, down 0.48 and the three-month rate at 20.93 percent, down 0.21, while the six-month rate was fixed at 21.01 percent, unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
